# Ponder Rule

When conducting code reviews, architecture evaluations, or multi-unit audits:
- Run repeated grading passes over every enumerated unit until findings stabilize.
- Do not conclude or approve while units remain ungraded.
- Verify findings across all four perspectives: Skeptic, Builder, Dreamer, and Empath.
- Stop only when coverage reaches 1.00 and consecutive quiet passes show zero churn.
